"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/#solutions\">← Explore solutions</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Everyday compliance admin</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Spend less time<br><span class=\"text-blue\">chasing documents.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Keep the next action in view. Connect requests, evidence and review dates so your team can spend more of its time reviewing records and helping people get ready for work.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">Review your workflow <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#collect\">See how it works ↓</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">For HR and operations teams handling recurring checks.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Bring the daily work into view</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Give each task a next step</p><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Request evidence</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Riley · Workplace induction</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Collect</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Review a document</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Alex · Training certificate</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Review</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Arrange a renewal</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Jamie · Manual handling</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Renew</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Open the record.<br>Pick up the work.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Keep the requirement and supporting evidence together.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"wrap outcome-nav\"><a href=\"#collect\" data-chapter-link=\"collect\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span>Collect evidence</a><a href=\"#prioritise\" data-chapter-link=\"prioritise\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span>Prioritise work</a><a href=\"#workload-section\" data-chapter-link=\"workload-section\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span>Measure the effort</a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"collect\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Collect with context</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Ask for the evidence<br>the role actually needs.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Start with a shared set of requirements. Workers can see what they need to supply, and your team can review the evidence against the role.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Separate evidence you are still waiting for from documents your team needs to review.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The right starting point</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-5 text-blue\">Start with the role</p><h3 class=\"mb-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Care assistant</h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm text-slate\">Your requirements shape the record.</p><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Workplace induction</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Set by your organisation</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Evidence and expiry date</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Identity document</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Review by your team</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie’s next step</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Add the requested evidence.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"prioritise\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Follow the work</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Find the next action<br>without rebuilding the list.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Bring missing evidence, approaching renewals and pending reviews into the workforce view. Open the relevant record with the context beside it.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Keep company records and shared personal credentials connected to the requirements they support.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-risk/\">See how to follow a compliance gap <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The team comes into view</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line pb-5\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Workforce overview</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold\">What needs attention?</h3></div><span class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Your team</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Manual handling</p></div><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Renewal due</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Alex Morgan</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Workplace induction</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Awaiting review</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Riley Ellis</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Requested evidence</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Missing</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-slate\">Open the person’s record to see the evidence behind the status.</p></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"workload-section\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Understand the effort</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Measure the chasing<br>your team does today.</h2><p class=\"copy\">How much of the week goes into following up documents? Use your own numbers to establish a starting point for a workflow review.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Count the recurring follow-ups. Include the time spent finding the request, contacting the person and updating your tracker.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Put a number on the work</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><form id=\"workload\" class=\"sheet\" aria-label=\"Estimate current weekly admin time\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold\" for=\"tasks\">Document follow-ups each week<input class=\"field mt-2\" id=\"tasks\" name=\"tasks\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100000\" step=\"1\" value=\"40\" required inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"workload-note\"></label><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold\" for=\"minutes\">Average minutes per follow-up<input class=\"field mt-2\" id=\"minutes\" name=\"minutes\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1440\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" required inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"workload-note\"></label></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-t-2 border-blue pt-5\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Your current weekly time</p><output id=\"workload-result\" for=\"tasks minutes\" class=\"mt-2 block font-mono text-4xl\" aria-live=\"polite\">4 hours</output><p id=\"workload-formula\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">40 follow-ups × 6 minutes ÷ 60</p></div><p id=\"workload-note\" class=\"mt-5 text-xs text-slate\">Change the example inputs to match your team. This estimates current effort, not a promised saving. Your inputs stay in this browser.</p></form></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Keep the work connected</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring your starting records with you.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><p class=\"copy\">If your team still works from a spreadsheet, plan the first import before changing the day-to-day process.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/outcomes/import-compliance-records/\">Plan your record import <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/\">Explore the full Certifyd story →</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring a recurring task.<br>Find a clearer way through.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Choose a document request or renewal your team handles often. We’ll walk through where the work sits and how Certifyd connects it.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a workflow review <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
